# The company library: the structure is tracked, the documents are not.
# A trade licence, ISO certificates and test reports are the company's own
# papers, and a datasheet library runs to hundreds of megabytes. A clone gets
# the shape and fills it with `backend/scripts/sync_library.py`.
backend/library/**
!backend/library/README.md
!backend/library/**/
!backend/library/**/.gitkeep

# Derived data: the datasheet index, rebuilt from the library on demand.
backend/.cache/
